that cover Sval's code: the GNU Affero General Public License 3.0 with the Sval
App Store Permission for Sval's own files, and the Mozilla Public License 2.0
for the files derived from Mozilla's. A copy is
unmodified when neither its code nor its art has been changed.

Modified versions. If you change Sval, you may use and share your version
under those same licenses, but it is not Sval. Before you distribute it,
replace every file listed below with art of your own, and do not present it
under Sval's name or marks. This is the same rule Mozilla's trademark policy
applies to Sval as a modified version of Firefox.

No other license to this art is granted. TRADEMARKS.md says how Sval's name
and logo may be used.

Paths are relative to the repository root. `*` matches any file name within
one directory.

